SaneBar — adapted menu-extra traversal and native reordering
https://github.com/sane-apps/SaneBar
Pinned commit: 2311b2379018dd67e4134866b1ce4d599227d457
Sources: Core/Services/AccessibilityMenuExtraService.swift and
Core/Services/AccessibilityMenuBarDragService.swift.
Adapted in Sources/WindowKit/MenuBar/MenuBarInventory.swift and MenuBarMove.swift.
